sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Desktop app
    participant API as "Auth API"
    participant DB
    U->>App: Click Sign in
    App->>+API: POST /session
    Note over App,API: TLS, retried with the same key
    loop Until the code is accepted
        API->>DB: check code
        DB-->>API: valid
    end
    alt code ok
        API-->>-App: 200 token
    else expired
        API--xApp: 401
    end
    App-)U: Signed in
    Note right of U: done
